# Interface Ace (0/4): "This creature saddles Mounts and crews Vehicles using its toughness rather than its power" (CR 702.122b, 702.171c).
# Its power 0 could never pay Dependable Quinjet's Crew 4, its toughness of 4 does alone; Class-F Shuttlecraft's Station (CR 702.184a) is
# neither, so tapped for it the Ace counts its power of 0: no charge counters. "Whenever this creature becomes tapped during your turn,
# untap it. This ability triggers only once each turn" (CR 701.26a, 603.2): the station untaps it on turn 3, the crew after that taps it
# for good that turn, and on turn 5 crewing untaps it again.

